{
  "id": "27005_yochisuru",
  "headword": "{予知|よち}する",
  "reading": "よちする",
  "romaji": "yochisuru",
  "part_of_speech": "suru verb",
  "gloss": "to predict; to foresee",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to predict; to foresee; to foretell",
      "explanation": "To know or sense in advance that something will happen, especially natural disasters or future events."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "27005_yochisuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{地震|じしん}を{予知|よち}するのは{難|むずか}しい。",
      "english": "Predicting earthquakes is difficult.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27005_yochisuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{動物|どうぶつ}は{災害|さいがい}を{予知|よち}する{能力|のうりょく}があると{言|い}われている。",
      "english": "It is said that animals have the ability to foresee disasters.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27005_yochisuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{将来|しょうらい}のことを{完全|かんぜん}に{予知|よち}することは{誰|だれ}にもできない。",
      "english": "No one can completely foresee the future.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Often used in the context of natural disasters, especially earthquakes ({地震予知|じしんよち}). Implies knowing something before it happens through sensing or scientific means, not through deliberate calculation or analysis.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {地震予知|じしんよち}: earthquake prediction\n- {予知能力|よちのうりょく}: ability to foresee; precognition\n- {予知|よち}できない: unpredictable\n- {予知夢|よちゆめ}: prophetic dream\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {予測|よそく}する: to predict; to forecast — based on data and analysis; more scientific and rational\n- {予想|よそう}する: to expect; to anticipate — based on reasoning or guessing; more everyday\n- {予言|よげん}する: to prophesy — often implies a supernatural or mystical prediction\n- {予報|よほう}: forecast — used for weather and similar systematic predictions",
